# sweep: computer
# A Sidekick helper runs on this computer and Books is paired with it.
# Opening Books asks it quietly, and with nothing waiting nothing is said.
# Two articles are then clipped for later on the computer, and Sync brings
# them over: the shelf says how many arrived and lists them.
wait-for Articles
tap Articles
wait-for No articles yet
expect-missing Checking your computer
expect-missing Nothing new
companion clip crates/kobo-article/fixtures/synthetic-news.html --url https://news.example.org/harbour --no-pictures --later
companion clip crates/kobo-article/fixtures/synthetic-blog.html --url https://blog.example.org/rivers --no-pictures --later
tap Sync
wait-for 2 articles arrived
wait-for Harbour wall to be rebuilt after winter storms
expect Measuring tide heights with a pressure sensor
# The runtime's own card announces them too; it is let go first.
wait 4500
clean
shot books-articles-synced
tap Sync
wait-for Nothing new
clean
shot books-articles-nothing-new
